<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-15T11:18:21.495Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:18:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican army units are engaging in street shootouts while hunting cartel gangsters in Jalisco and other states, and a police helicopter opened fire on a cartel chase near the U.S. border, killing a 7-year-old girl. Antonio Oseguera Cervantes, brother of Jalisco New Generation co-founder El Mencho, was sentenced to 22 years in a U.S. prison for a drug-trafficking plot, and other cartel relatives received comparable long sentences. An ICE officer in Maine shot and killed an immigrant after expressing hatred of immigrants. Guatemala declared an emergency in its eastern region over drug violence, and Chinese money-laundering networks are linked to thriving narco broker operations. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQTG1GV3RRaHUwc1h3U0lQTVh4aUtsbDlheGEwOXhtUV9fOVBBbWNZOTIyY2hDWTJSXy1ndmQxQ20zREoxQ19KRTlSQnNYWnVJRGZET3ROUGN4aXRqcm9ZQWRpUjNvQTl1ZTJDS0VBMnVkclhtU1VadHlRZHNpOV9zMVg1TmE0bGRFU1pIU29LSldzWEZnYnNBN3QtSThyeUxHSTgtQg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxONTVpd1dVelJiVVI0YjdMM2NvLWJvZXgxS1ljbXBuT1NGdXNDNTZGbUNiS0drakVseGZSMWgyUjFvSUcyWkFORV9JdjFPZU0yODNlUnNrajJ6M2xXeU5ZTlE0LVpUcXVlcW92QmJzWnhXbjNPb1drWUtSR0xmVzE2SFEtb3ZVQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE5ibFpZN0JRLXcwdjNVX0Zmc21vaHczV1A3SmdXRzZ2RWpYOXlTelhJNGY0U1ByR2otVjlLaFhpTEQ2amFMUDdkVVlvQzJWV19fZGVNSEJaaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangladesh Sangbad Sangstha (BSS)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;EL PAÍS English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTFBnNXBQSjlLRnFxblRNRW5xYjBwbi0ySE1tNlV6ZUhNU3VqdURTSUZwendMM1pDZmV1MUcxNWlQcDlJSTAzekZIeTJmU0R2cGxEWU03ODF